            "[Hosting provider]: servers, databases and file storage, located in the European Union ([region]).",
            "Cloudflare (network protection and delivery). All traffic to our app and servers passes through Cloudflare, which protects us from attacks. Cloudflare processes your IP address and the technical data of each request for us, as our processor. Cloudflare, Inc. is located in the United States. Transfers rely on the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework and on the Standard Contractual Clauses in Cloudflare's data processing addendum. [Cloudflare's log period: owner to confirm.]",
            "Cloudflare Turnstile (bot protection). When you sign up, sign in after several failed tries, or send the public report form, Cloudflare checks that you are a person. It receives your IP address and technical data about your browser and device, for us, as our processor, under the same agreement and safeguards as above. Turnstile does not use cookies for advertising.",
            "LiveKit: real-time voice and video. [Owner to confirm: LiveKit Cloud as a processor, or LiveKit software running on our own servers at the hosting provider.]",
            "Resend: sending service emails such as verification and password reset. Resend receives your email address and the content of the email.",
            "Klipy (GIF search): see below.",
            "Stripe and PayPal (payments). Payments are not switched on yet, so neither receives any data from us. When they are, they process your payment details for us; for some purposes, such as fraud prevention and legal duties, they may act as independent controllers under their own privacy policies. We will update this policy before payments start.",
            "Push-notification services: when you turn on notifications, a notification token and the notification content pass through the push service of your device or browser (for example Apple, Google or your browser maker).",
